---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Bluehost Review - VPSTier.com" description="Bluehost VPS hosting review: starting at $3.95/mo, free domain, SSL, and 24/7 support. WordPress-recommended since 2005.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Bluehost Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">$50-150/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>90 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit Bluehost →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.2/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Bluehost is one of the most established names in web hosting, recommended by WordPress.org since 2005. Their VPS plans offer a good balance of price, performance, and ease of use — especially for developers coming from shared hosting.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $3.95/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-orange-400 text-2xl font-bold mb-1">$3.95</div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">/mo starting price</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-orange-400 text-2xl font-bold mb-1">3 Cores</div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">vCPU on standard plan</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-orange-400 text-2xl font-bold mb-1">30GB</div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">NVMe SSD storage</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ WordPress-recommended since 2005</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Free domain + SSL for first year</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 24/7 live chat and phone support</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ One-click WordPress install</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ NVMe SSD on VPS plans</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Root access on VPS plans</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Renewal prices are higher</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ US-based only (no Asia datacenters)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Aggressive upselling during checkout</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Pricing Plans</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Standard VPS</span>
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$3.95/mo</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm block">2 vCPU, 2GB RAM, 50GB NVMe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Power VPS</span>
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$5.95/mo</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm block">3 vCPU, 4GB RAM, 100GB NVMe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Pro VPS</span>
          <div class="text-right">
            <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$13.95/mo</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm block">4 vCPU, 8GB RAM, 200GB NVMe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-4">Prices for new customers. Renewal rates are ~2x higher.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link ($50-150/sale)
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
